# Pad only to a Quick Race (the synthetic pad, NFSU2_PAD_FAKE=PLUG=1), then
# in the race: analog steering, the triggers as separate throttle and brake
# axes (half and full pull), RB e-brake; the focus rule (another app in front:
# the pad reads at rest; back in front with the trigger still pulled: at rest
# until it is let go) and a key held through a focus loss (released).
0:untilpad:START:MC_Background.fng:120
+200:untilpad:A:UI_QRModeSelect.fng:300
+200:untilpad:A:UI_QRTrackSelect.fng:150
+200:untilpad:A:UI_QRModeOptions.fng:150
+200:untilpad:A:UI_QRCarSelect.fng:150
+200:untilpad:A:PC_Loading.fng:150
+1500:log:race
+0:in
+0:pad:LX=-0.5
+30:in
+0:pad:LX=0;RT=0.5
+30:in
+0:pad:RT=1
+30:in
+120:shot
+5:pad:RT=0;LT=0.5
+30:in
+0:pad:LT=0;RB=1
+30:in
+0:pad:RB=0;RT=1
+60:in
+0:log:focus lost with the right trigger pulled
+0:focus:out
+10:in
+60:focus:in
+30:in
+0:log:trigger let go and pulled again
+0:pad:RT=0
+10:pad:RT=1
+30:in
+0:pad:OFF
+30:log:a key held through a focus loss
+0:down:LEFT
+30:in
+0:focus:out
+10:in
+0:focus:in
+20:up:LEFT
+30:log:end
